{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24057","headline":"晚归香山寺因咏所怀 · 白居易","name":"晚归香山寺因咏所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我年日已老，我身日已闲。\n闲出都门望，但见水与山。\n关塞碧岩岩，伊流清潺潺。\n中有古精舍，轩户无扃关。\n岸草歇可藉，迳萝行可攀。\n朝随浮云出，夕与飞鸟还。\n吾道本迂拙，世途多险艰。\n尝闻嵇吕辈，尤悔生疎顽。\n巢悟入箕颍，皓知返商巅。\n岂唯乐肥遁，聊复祛忧患。\n吾亦从此去，终老伊嵩间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}